  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Verification and caveats",
     "texto": [
      "**Etterprøvbarhet** means that other people can check the basis of a claim. A **forbehold** limits how certain we can be when concluding."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Rephrasing with precision",
     "texto": [
      "When summarising a source, distinguish between what it documents and what it merely suggests. You can use expressions such as **according to**, **it seems that** and **it is not clear whether**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
